"""wraith — names whose definitions died but whose mentions remain.

The type-checker for the untyped fringe: docs, configs, scripts, comments,
and string literals. Compilers catch unbound identifiers in code. Wraith
catches the leftovers they never see.

Exit codes:
  0  no holdouts
  1  usage / git / I/O error
  2  holdouts found
"""

